Usage: agent-deck group reorder <name> [options]

Reorder a group among its siblings.

Options:
  -d	Move group down one position (short)
  -down
    	Move group down one position
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -p int
    	Move group to specific position (short) (default -1)
  -position int
    	Move group to specific position (0-indexed) (default -1)
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
  -u	Move group up one position (short)
  -up
    	Move group up one position

Examples:
  agent-deck group reorder mobile --up
  agent-deck group reorder mobile --down
  agent-deck group reorder mobile --position 0
